{
  "version": 1,
  "change": "lifecycle-vocabulary-single-declaration",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "id": "one-canonical-terminal-declaration",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/the-terminal-status-vocabulary-has-exactly-one-canonical-declaration"
      ],
      "describe": "全树能独立回答『是否终态』的**定义载体**恰好 1 处（contracts 那份 canonical）。四种载体：① 元素恰为四终态的数组/Set 字面量；② 覆盖恰好这四个的等值链；③ case 标签恰为这四个、不含非终态标签的 switch（子集 + default 兜底，加第五个终态会静默落进 default）；④ 恰为这四个的字面量类型联合。单双引号皆认、含测试文件、不认符号名。⚠ **本断言被 verify 连续打脸四轮，每轮都是形状盲区、没有一轮是名字问题**：v1 只 grep `export const`；v2 只认 const/let/var+单引号；v3 只认数组与等值链；v4 漏了类型联合——而 spec 正文本身就把 guardrails.service.ts 的**两处类型联合**算作真复述，所以旧判据与需求正文自相矛盾，是「编译期擦除故不算」这条辩解掩盖了矛盾。**编译期擦除不是豁免理由**：它仍是「谁是终态」的第二处书写，加第五个终态时不更新也不报错。载体③ 按 **switch 花括号配对**切块而非行距——块内注释一长会把全量映射切成假子集（本刀实测踩过）。两类合法测试输入按形态排除而非按路径（路径豁免会腐烂）：`for (… of […])` 迭代对象、Prisma 期望查询的 `in: […]`——改成派生会让期望值与实际值同源，断言就自证了。【base64 内联：脚本含引号/换行/正则反斜杠，走 shell 双引号会被吞掉；本刀不建新闸门脚本（proposal Impact 已裁定）。】",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "python3 -c 'import base64;exec(base64.b64decode(\"\").decode())'"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutEquals": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "no-forwarding-alias-for-terminal-set",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/the-terminal-status-vocabulary-has-exactly-one-canonical-declaration"
      ],
      "describe": "退役的声明没有留下换名转发（re-export 会让两个名字回来，却看起来像修好了）",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "grep -rn 'export {[^}]*TERMINAL_TASK_STATUSES[^}]*}\\|export .* TERMINAL_TASK_STATUSES as ' apps/api/src --include='*.ts' || true"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutAbsent": "TERMINAL_TASK_STATUSES"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "device-login-namesake-untouched",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/the-terminal-status-vocabulary-has-exactly-one-canonical-declaration"
      ],
      "describe": "同名异义的 DeviceLoginStatus 终态集合原封不动（符号名扫描会扫到它）",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "grep -c 'const TERMINAL_STATUSES = new Set<DeviceLoginStatus>' apps/api/src/settings/codex-device-login.service.ts"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutEquals": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "restatement-site-count",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/restatements-of-the-terminal-vocabulary-are-counted-per-site-and-the-convention-s-false-positives-are-named"
      ],
      "describe": "复述站点数按口径（四字面量单引号同 8 行窗口共现、非重叠推进、排除三类测试后缀）实测；改动前 15，预测 5",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "python3 -c \"import io,os;L=[chr(39)+s+chr(39) for s in ('completed','failed','cancelled','agent_failed_to_start')];F=[os.path.join(d,f) for r in ('apps','packages','scripts') for d,_,fz in os.walk(r) if not any(s in d for s in ('node_modules','dist','.turbo')) for f in fz if f.endswith(('.ts','.tsx','.mjs')) and not f.endswith(('.spec.ts','.test.ts','.test.mjs'))];n=0\nfor p in F:\n    ls=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore').read().split(chr(10));i=0\n    while i<len(ls):\n        if all(x in chr(10).join(ls[i:i+8]) for x in L): n+=1;i+=8\n        else: i+=1\nprint(n)\""
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutEquals": "5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "false-positives-still-enumerate-every-arm",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/restatements-of-the-terminal-vocabulary-are-counted-per-site-and-the-convention-s-false-positives-are-named"
      ],
      "describe": "两处口径假阳性（对整个状态枚举的穷尽 switch）仍逐个列举 pending 与 awaiting_input——被『修』成消费终态集合会去掉编译器强制的穷尽性（合成单行后用 stdoutEquals：spec-assert 的 stdoutMatches 拿**未 trim** 的 stdout 比对，JS 的 $ 不像 Perl 那样容忍结尾换行，多行 ^…$ 会必然不匹配）",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "{ grep -c \"case 'awaiting_input'\" apps/api/src/audit/audit-mapping.ts; grep -c \"case 'task.awaiting_input'\" apps/api/src/v1/v1-events.controller.ts; } | tr '\\n' ' ' | sed 's/ *$//'"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutEquals": "1 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails-derives-not-restates",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/restatements-of-the-terminal-vocabulary-are-counted-per-site-and-the-convention-s-false-positives-are-named"
      ],
      "describe": "编排器里五处终态复述全部消失（含本地重声明的 isTerminalTaskStatus）",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "grep -n \"function isTerminalTaskStatus\" apps/api/src/guardrails/guardrails.service.ts || true"
