        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/restatements-of-the-terminal-vocabulary-are-counted-per-site-and-the-convention-s-false-positives-are-named"
      ],
      "describe": "编排器不再自持第二个终态谓词。⚠ 本条经历两次订正：最初写成「不得 import @/task-lifecycle，否则造出 cross-context finding」——**两处都错**。两者同属 task-execution，且 application→domain 是合法方向（实测闸门四类计数一动不动）。最终形态是各取所有者：**词表**取自 contracts（guardrails:22 早已 import），**谓词**取自领域模块的 isTerminal，全仓只剩一个。",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "grep -n 'function isTerminalTaskStatus' apps/api/src/guardrails/guardrails.service.ts || true"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "stdoutAbsent": "function isTerminalTaskStatus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "admission-subset-declared-once",
      "requirements": [
        "task-lifecycle-vocabulary/the-admission-transition-subset-is-declared-once-and-consumed-not-restated"
      ],
      "describe": "admission 子集不再以 Extract<TaskStatus, 'pending'|'queued'|'running'> 的形式被复述",
      "run": [
        "bash",
        "-c",
        "grep -rn \"Extract<[[:space:]]*TaskStatus\" apps/api/src --include='*.ts' | grep \"'pending'\" || true"
